WEBVTT

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.660
Both today and tomorrow, I've got time to kick back.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.660
kyou mo ashita mo HIMAKKUSU

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
My family of four and I are going to stay the night.

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
gokazoku yonin de goippaku

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
Put on an Egyptian front and become a sphinx,

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
EGIPUTO kidori de SUFINKUSU

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
and for an American feeling, Texas!

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
AMERICA kibun de TEXAS

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
When you're sitting pretty, with enough and to spare,

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
yoyuu SHAKUSHAKUPPE itsumo

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
and yet you always shilly-shally,

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
funya funya de iruto

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:39.890
and your bitter face and bitter feelings both teeter-totter,

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:39.890
nigamushi hara no mushi nahe nahe to

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
it's time to get out of there!

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
tettai shichau yo

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.730
I am feeling Ultra Relax,

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.730
watashi ha URUTORA RIRAKKUSU

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.940
a wonderful, invincible Relax.

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.940
SUTEKI ni muteki na RIRAKKUSU

00:00:50.280 --> 00:00:52.940
A one-step-above kind of Deluxe.

00:00:50.280 --> 00:00:52.940
hito aji chigau ze DERAKKUSU

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:54.070
I may be a little jumbled,

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:54.070
toccharakatte mo

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:55.860
but when I'm called on, ba-ba-ba-ba-bang!

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:55.860
yobarerya PAPAPAPAAAN!

00:00:56.240 --> 00:00:58.910
I always feel Relax,

00:00:56.240 --> 00:00:58.910
watashi ha itsudemo RIRAKKUSU

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.870
a humble, simple, sort of Deluxe.

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.870
WABISABI kikasete DERAKKUSU

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
Bright! Clear! Alert-headed, peep-peep!

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
BIKKARI! KIKKARI! saeteru ATAMA PII! PII!

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.920
Keep your eyes on me, okay!?

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.920
watashi no KOTO dake mitete ne!

00:01:32.860 --> 00:01:36.030
I'm Kurata Sana, first year Junior
High School student.

00:01:36.030 --> 00:01:39.120
Award winning writer Mama
and the squirrel Maro-chan.

00:01:39.120 --> 00:01:41.530
Manager and driver, Rei-kun.

00:01:41.530 --> 00:01:44.950
The mysterious white bat, Babbit.

00:01:44.950 --> 00:01:49.080
Hayama Akito, lonely wolf doing
karate and my friend.

00:01:49.080 --> 00:01:53.130
Matsui Fuka, the girl I met in the
bathroom and is now my best friend.

00:01:56.630 --> 00:02:00.180
Will you be my real boyfriend?

00:02:02.680 --> 00:02:07.190
Love Awakened
After Loss

00:02:10.270 --> 00:02:12.650
Hayama, are you doing well?

00:02:14.570 --> 00:02:19.820
There's only a quarter left to film.

00:02:20.320 --> 00:02:22.700
It was kinda fast but kinda slow.

00:02:22.700 --> 00:02:25.540
But I'm feeling better
and doing my best.

00:02:27.710 --> 00:02:30.170
Hayama, are you still the same?

00:02:30.830 --> 00:02:33.460
Huh? How strange.

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:38.930
Whenever I write letters
I become noisy!

00:02:38.930 --> 00:02:42.100
We are noisy girls.

00:02:42.100 --> 00:02:45.220
If you're gonna say that,
it's okay.

00:02:47.180 --> 00:02:49.310
Are you okay?!

00:02:49.310 --> 00:02:52.770
Oh! I got it I got it!
This is good.

00:02:54.190 --> 00:02:55.820
Sana-chan, it's time to go.

00:02:55.820 --> 00:02:57.360
Are you writing a letter?

00:02:57.360 --> 00:02:59.030
Ah! Nothing! Nothing!

00:02:59.030 --> 00:03:02.120
It's a person I can't see again even
though I really want to.

00:03:02.120 --> 00:03:04.280
Ah! It's to Sensei then.

00:03:07.450 --> 00:03:12.540
Hayama... I haven't seen him for
a billion years.

00:03:13.630 --> 00:03:18.340
I wonder what you want to tell me
when I come back.

00:03:18.340 --> 00:03:20.050
What is it?

00:03:21.720 --> 00:03:23.470
Cut... ok.

00:03:23.800 --> 00:03:27.390
I keep remembering about you,
Hayama.

00:03:27.390 --> 00:03:28.850
Are you okay?!

00:03:29.350 --> 00:03:31.730
Come on, Rei-kun.

00:03:32.480 --> 00:03:35.690
It doesn't hurt that much anymore,
it's ok now.

00:03:40.450 --> 00:03:42.990
Hmm... just a little longer.

00:03:42.990 --> 00:03:45.740
It seems like you're looking
forward for the filming to end.

00:03:45.740 --> 00:03:46.950
Eh? Really?

00:03:46.950 --> 00:03:50.540
When I think about tomorrow,
I want it to end soon too...

00:03:51.080 --> 00:03:53.710
Give me your leg so I can change
your bandage.

00:03:53.710 --> 00:03:56.500
Rei-kun, really!
It doesn't hurt anymore.

00:03:56.880 --> 00:04:00.920
Don't hide it in, I know that it
hurts. At least tell me.

00:04:00.920 --> 00:04:04.090
Oh, I see. It hurts a little bit.

00:04:05.760 --> 00:04:09.930
Tomorrow you should see the doctor
at the foot of the mountains.

00:04:09.930 --> 00:04:13.140
No! Tomorrow we're going to film
the important fire scene!

00:04:13.140 --> 00:04:15.060
I've practiced so hard at rehearsals

00:04:15.060 --> 00:04:17.190
and have been going along with Naozumi-kun!

00:04:17.190 --> 00:04:20.030
I just want to charge forward and
get it over with!

00:04:20.030 --> 00:04:21.190
But...

00:04:21.400 --> 00:04:23.150
I beg you!

00:04:24.820 --> 00:04:27.200
Oh, controlled manager.

00:04:37.340 --> 00:04:41.090
Too bad... I'm in love with you.

00:04:42.840 --> 00:04:44.590
Cut.

00:04:47.300 --> 00:04:49.390
I need a moment with Sana-chan.

00:04:50.930 --> 00:04:53.520
The expression was good...

00:04:53.520 --> 00:04:54.980
but...

00:04:55.850 --> 00:04:58.480
that line...

00:04:58.480 --> 00:04:59.860
Yes?

00:05:00.690 --> 00:05:02.690
It isn't right.

00:05:02.690 --> 00:05:06.200
When you first realize
that you're in love.

00:05:06.200 --> 00:05:07.070
Yes?

00:05:07.070 --> 00:05:08.490
How did it feel?

00:05:09.160 --> 00:05:12.080
What would you feel like,
Sana-chan?

00:05:12.080 --> 00:05:13.410
Actually...

00:05:20.130 --> 00:05:23.630
10 Minutes Later

00:05:21.630 --> 00:05:23.590
You old geezer.

00:05:26.380 --> 00:05:31.510
Geez, I don't get what that stupid
director is saying.

00:05:31.510 --> 00:05:37.230
I sort of understood what to say
about the line.

00:05:37.230 --> 00:05:41.650
It's not ordinary love.
I think I've got it now.

00:05:41.980 --> 00:05:43.570
Oh I see.

00:05:44.360 --> 00:05:46.700
Let's put some ice on your leg now.

00:05:51.490 --> 00:05:53.700
- Rei-kun.
- Hmm?

00:05:53.700 --> 00:05:58.040
I really think this movie will
turn out great.

00:05:59.630 --> 00:06:01.170
I really think so!

00:06:01.170 --> 00:06:05.970
So I want to act to my fullest abilities.

00:06:06.340 --> 00:06:10.600
People who watch will feel something.

00:06:11.800 --> 00:06:13.100
Okay.

00:06:15.100 --> 00:06:16.430
Hayama Aki!

00:06:16.770 --> 00:06:19.350
Naozumi-kun!
Can I blow your trumpet?

00:06:19.350 --> 00:06:20.560
Can you do it?

00:06:20.560 --> 00:06:22.940
There's nothing I can't do!

00:06:23.270 --> 00:06:27.110
See, there are things you can't do
with just strength.

00:06:27.110 --> 00:06:28.240
Akito!

00:06:28.240 --> 00:06:30.360
Sana-chan's on TV, look!

00:06:31.870 --> 00:06:35.910
Maybe what the tabloids said
about them is true.

00:06:35.910 --> 00:06:38.500
She seems to look good with
Kamura-kun.

00:06:40.040 --> 00:06:43.840
I'm so jealous, Akito. If you just
sit there Sana-chan will be taken...

00:06:52.140 --> 00:06:55.350
How is everyone? Is Fuka well?

00:06:55.430 --> 00:06:58.390
Rough Feelings

00:06:55.680 --> 00:06:57.310
Babbit is doing well!

00:06:58.940 --> 00:07:02.270
I bet I missed a lot of homework.

00:07:02.610 --> 00:07:04.610
What if I can't catch up?

00:07:04.610 --> 00:07:07.190
Hayama, will you help me again?

00:07:07.190 --> 00:07:09.740
Yeah, just like you did
in 6th grade.

00:07:10.200 --> 00:07:12.410
Ah, that was bad...

00:07:13.910 --> 00:07:16.660
But those days are nostalgic.

00:07:16.660 --> 00:07:19.620
Now I want to go back to school
again tomorrow.

00:07:19.960 --> 00:07:23.540
There's a lot of things on my mind
but everything is going well.

00:07:23.540 --> 00:07:27.460
When you see me again, you'll see
the better actress, Kurata Sana.

00:07:27.460 --> 00:07:31.720
Ah, I'm just kidding.
So keep doing well.

00:07:32.390 --> 00:07:35.350
How many days go by
in just one letter...

00:07:35.350 --> 00:07:39.600
I'll ask Rei-kun to mail it tomorrow.

00:07:48.940 --> 00:07:50.320
Hayama...

00:07:50.320 --> 00:07:53.110
There's actually a lot of bad
things happening.

00:07:53.110 --> 00:07:55.030
I hurt my leg.

00:07:55.030 --> 00:07:58.040
There are bad rumors about
me and Naozumi-kun,

00:07:58.040 --> 00:07:59.950
but there's really nothing between us.

00:08:00.290 --> 00:08:02.000
Sana-chan! Go to bed!
Hurry go to bed!

00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:04.380
If you don't get enough sleep
you won't have beautiful skin!

00:08:04.380 --> 00:08:07.550
Sometimes I think I want to hear
your voice.

00:08:07.550 --> 00:08:11.880
If you could just tell me to do my best,
then I could really do my best.

00:08:12.130 --> 00:08:14.010
Hmm... Letter?

00:08:14.010 --> 00:08:15.010
Yes.

00:08:15.010 --> 00:08:18.470
If you're going to the town at the
foot of the mountains, please mail this.

00:08:18.470 --> 00:08:20.430
Today I didn't have that in mind...

00:08:20.430 --> 00:08:23.140
but Maeda-san said he was going
in the afternoon.

00:08:23.140 --> 00:08:24.560
I'll ask him later.

00:08:25.020 --> 00:08:26.270
Sana-chan!

00:08:26.270 --> 00:08:28.020
Look what I found.

00:08:28.900 --> 00:08:31.990
Sagami-san,
bring Sana-chan here please.

00:08:31.990 --> 00:08:33.360
This way, this way!

00:08:33.360 --> 00:08:35.320
What the...?

00:08:44.370 --> 00:08:46.420
Why did you bring me here?

00:08:47.750 --> 00:08:49.090
Ta-da!

00:08:49.090 --> 00:08:52.300
Asako, you know a cell phone
won't work here.

00:08:52.300 --> 00:08:54.130
- Others cell phones won't.
- Others?

00:08:54.130 --> 00:08:56.050
This is the director's cell phone.

00:08:56.050 --> 00:09:00.140
But if you use it in this place
it works without reasons.

00:09:00.470 --> 00:09:02.180
Eh? Oh really?

00:09:02.180 --> 00:09:03.060
Yup!

00:09:03.060 --> 00:09:05.810
Here, Sana-chan. You wanted
to use the phone, right?

00:09:05.810 --> 00:09:07.690
Thank you, Asako-san!

00:09:07.690 --> 00:09:10.570
Well, we're going to leave
you alone. Let's go, Rei.

00:09:18.200 --> 00:09:20.910
It's Sunday, I wonder if he's home.

00:09:21.330 --> 00:09:24.040
I wonder who Sana-chan's
going to call first.

00:09:24.040 --> 00:09:26.330
Of course it'll be Sensei.

00:09:27.670 --> 00:09:31.340
Ah! Hello?
Is Hayama-san there?

00:09:31.340 --> 00:09:33.800
- It seems to be Hayama-san.
- Why?

00:09:33.800 --> 00:09:36.260
Hello! Been a long time!
Kurata here!

00:09:36.590 --> 00:09:38.470
Ku... Kurata?

00:09:38.470 --> 00:09:41.600
Hayama! It's me!
Are you doing well?

00:09:41.600 --> 00:09:43.180
You could say that...

00:09:43.180 --> 00:09:45.140
Right now it's break time.

00:09:45.140 --> 00:09:47.770
The phone somehow works and I got
through to you.

00:09:47.770 --> 00:09:50.270
- Are you listening?
- Yeah.

00:09:50.270 --> 00:09:53.730
You said you wanted
to tell me something.

00:09:53.730 --> 00:09:57.450
What was it about? What was it?
Tell me what it was!

00:09:57.450 --> 00:09:59.030
What is it?

00:10:00.700 --> 00:10:01.870
Actually...

00:10:01.870 --> 00:10:03.080
Yeah?

00:10:04.830 --> 00:10:06.120
It's over.

00:10:06.120 --> 00:10:07.920
What do you mean?

00:10:07.920 --> 00:10:10.210
Oh, I have another call,
hold on a minute.

00:10:10.210 --> 00:10:11.710
Ok.

00:10:17.420 --> 00:10:19.930
I'll tell him I got bra.

00:10:19.930 --> 00:10:21.140
Oh, my bad.

00:10:21.140 --> 00:10:24.010
Ah, hello, who was that?
Tsuyoshi-kun?

00:10:24.010 --> 00:10:27.480
Fuka, is she OK?

00:10:28.390 --> 00:10:29.520
Kurata...

00:10:29.520 --> 00:10:30.770
Eh?

00:10:47.200 --> 00:10:50.500
Oh yeah, is that so?

00:10:50.500 --> 00:10:53.040
Wow, what a surprise.

00:10:54.210 --> 00:10:57.300
Well, they're starting.

00:10:57.300 --> 00:11:01.180
Yeah, see you later.

00:11:13.900 --> 00:11:19.360
Sana-chan! Maeda-san's ready to go.
Do you want me to send out your letter?

00:11:19.360 --> 00:11:20.820
Sana-chan...

00:11:21.360 --> 00:11:23.320
Should I send out your letter...?

00:11:24.160 --> 00:11:25.740
Sana-chan!

00:11:25.740 --> 00:11:29.290
Sana-chan! Sana-chan!
What's wrong, Sana-chan?

00:11:30.830 --> 00:11:34.630
Now I'm dating Fuka.

00:11:38.380 --> 00:11:41.630
Oyaho, what is it?

00:11:41.630 --> 00:11:42.760
{parte b}

00:11:43.640 --> 00:11:46.890
The answer is ohayo! (good morning)

00:11:52.100 --> 00:11:53.730
My bad, did you wait long?

00:11:53.730 --> 00:11:55.190
Nope.

00:11:55.190 --> 00:11:57.650
Did you tell Sana?

00:11:59.820 --> 00:12:01.360
Not really.

00:12:01.990 --> 00:12:03.610
I see.

00:12:10.000 --> 00:12:11.960
What's wrong, Sana-chan?

00:12:13.080 --> 00:12:15.500
Her expression makes her
look like she's dead.

00:12:15.500 --> 00:12:18.550
She's so different than usual,
she looks like a ghost.

00:12:18.550 --> 00:12:22.090
Great. Sana-chan is so great!

00:12:22.630 --> 00:12:24.930
Let's begin, places!

00:12:28.510 --> 00:12:30.100
Action!

00:12:45.950 --> 00:12:47.410
Y... y...

00:12:50.160 --> 00:12:54.710
Y... Y... You...

00:12:58.210 --> 00:13:00.050
Cut.

00:13:00.050 --> 00:13:01.670
Sana-chan!

00:13:01.670 --> 00:13:03.260
What's wrong, Sana-chan?

00:13:03.260 --> 00:13:04.840
That's enough for today.

00:13:05.880 --> 00:13:08.640
I'm sorry, I didn't mean to...

00:13:08.640 --> 00:13:12.270
Your wound really hurts, doesn't it?
You can rest for today.

00:13:12.270 --> 00:13:13.390
But...

00:13:13.390 --> 00:13:16.310
No, that's enough.
Hurry and get in shape.

00:13:16.900 --> 00:13:20.110
I don't want that kind of lifeless
expression in my movies.

00:13:20.110 --> 00:13:23.490
I could even hire a child just to
do that kind of thing.

00:13:23.490 --> 00:13:26.360
I don't think of you
and Kamura-kun as children.

00:13:26.360 --> 00:13:27.820
You understand, right?

00:13:28.030 --> 00:13:34.830
And it rained...

00:13:28.530 --> 00:13:34.620
Rain, it's raining,
the weather is bad.

00:13:45.840 --> 00:13:48.890
I looked like such an idiot.

00:13:52.010 --> 00:13:53.930
Naozumi-kun.

00:13:53.930 --> 00:13:56.270
Hurry please come in.

00:13:59.440 --> 00:14:03.320
What's wrong with Sana-chan?!
What's going on?

00:14:03.320 --> 00:14:06.450
Actually, I don't know either.

00:14:06.450 --> 00:14:09.410
The other day she talked on the phone with Hayama-kun...

00:14:09.410 --> 00:14:11.330
On the phone with Hayama?

00:14:12.080 --> 00:14:16.710
Right now Kurumi-san is taking
care of her in her cabin.

00:14:17.710 --> 00:14:19.330
Oh, wait!

00:14:21.540 --> 00:14:24.760
Relax and don't worry.

00:14:26.090 --> 00:14:27.170
Sana-chan!

00:14:28.510 --> 00:14:30.050
Sana-chan!

00:14:32.180 --> 00:14:35.140
What happened?
What did Hayama say to you?

00:14:35.140 --> 00:14:36.640
Tell me, Sana-chan!

00:14:36.640 --> 00:14:38.480
Naozumi-kun, calm down!

00:14:38.480 --> 00:14:40.730
- What happened?
- Calm down, Naozumi-kun.

00:14:40.730 --> 00:14:42.400
Tell me, Sana-chan!

00:14:42.400 --> 00:14:46.690
Come on give him something to blow on!
Wait, Naozumi-kun!

00:14:48.900 --> 00:14:50.860
Woo, thank God!

00:14:50.860 --> 00:14:52.950
I could have calmed down
without this.

00:14:52.830 --> 00:14:57.250
So he calmed down

00:14:53.080 --> 00:14:57.000
Rain, rain, how painful.

00:14:59.420 --> 00:15:03.290
Hey, you know Hayama and Fuka...

00:15:03.290 --> 00:15:06.050
Fuka is my best friend...

00:15:06.050 --> 00:15:08.510
They're going out now.

00:15:13.600 --> 00:15:18.140
I'm not sure. I was shocked.

00:15:18.770 --> 00:15:22.730
I'm best friends with both of them.

00:15:23.940 --> 00:15:28.030
It was so sudden... strange...

00:15:28.030 --> 00:15:31.410
It's a big shock to you, Sana-chan...

00:15:31.410 --> 00:15:35.410
But isn't it strange?

00:15:35.410 --> 00:15:38.580
That means that Sana-chan has
feelings for Hayama-kun.

00:15:38.580 --> 00:15:42.960
No, no! It's not like that at all!

00:15:42.960 --> 00:15:45.210
Hmm... it can't be.

00:15:45.210 --> 00:15:50.510
Fuka is a nice person. If I think
about it, it's good match.

00:15:51.340 --> 00:15:54.220
Hmm... I just can't agree
with that.

00:15:54.220 --> 00:15:55.930
Come on now, Sagami-san.

00:15:55.930 --> 00:15:59.480
That's all.
That's all really.

00:15:59.890 --> 00:16:02.390
It's fine, don't worry about me.

00:16:02.390 --> 00:16:04.900
Alright! Let's call him again...

00:16:05.480 --> 00:16:07.150
at the secret spot!

00:16:07.150 --> 00:16:08.820
Oops, secret supon.

00:16:08.820 --> 00:16:10.320
What secret supon?

00:16:10.320 --> 00:16:12.070
It's not a supon, it's a spot!

00:16:12.070 --> 00:16:15.120
Damn, I don't know his phone number!

00:16:15.120 --> 00:16:16.330
Tell me, Sana-chan!

00:16:16.330 --> 00:16:19.290
Stop it already! Please stop!

00:16:19.290 --> 00:16:22.160
The two of you leave.
I'll take care of things.

00:16:23.330 --> 00:16:24.710
Sana-chan!

00:16:25.170 --> 00:16:27.590
Sana-chan, are you alright?

00:16:31.130 --> 00:16:32.300
Here.

00:16:32.760 --> 00:16:35.640
Don't say anything.
You're welcome.

00:16:38.390 --> 00:16:43.980
Sorry, I was too nosy and let you
borrow that phone.

00:16:43.980 --> 00:16:46.190
No, it's ok.

00:16:46.190 --> 00:16:48.520
It was true I wanted
to phone someone.

00:16:48.520 --> 00:16:54.110
I hear everything from Rei-kun, so I know quite a lot about Hayama-kun.

00:16:54.110 --> 00:16:55.490
Oh, I see.

00:16:55.820 --> 00:16:59.080
Sana-chan, you do love
Hayama-kun, don't you?

00:16:59.080 --> 00:17:01.910
Me... Hayama?

00:17:02.450 --> 00:17:05.750
Of course.
That's why you called him first.

00:17:05.750 --> 00:17:07.710
Oh, that's not it at all.

00:17:07.710 --> 00:17:11.460
It's because I was wondering about
something so I was thinking what it was.

00:17:11.460 --> 00:17:15.380
So it's not love at all. That's right because I don't love him at all.

00:17:15.630 --> 00:17:16.680
Really?

00:17:16.680 --> 00:17:18.220
Not at all.

00:17:18.220 --> 00:17:21.680
I don't have a reason to like him at all.

00:17:21.680 --> 00:17:23.430
Eh? A reason?

00:17:23.430 --> 00:17:29.060
Well, my type is someone
nice like Rei-kun,

00:17:29.060 --> 00:17:32.610
and I want someone who's tall.
Hayama is just as tall as me.

00:17:32.610 --> 00:17:35.740
He's a leopard and a pervert and
he looks at me funny.

00:17:35.740 --> 00:17:41.700
Well... he has a nice side to him.

00:17:42.660 --> 00:17:44.160
But but...

00:17:44.160 --> 00:17:46.830
I really don't love him.

00:17:46.830 --> 00:17:52.090
Sana-chan, you don't need a reason
to love someone.

00:17:54.210 --> 00:17:58.140
You just realized you like him.
Love is like that.

00:17:58.840 --> 00:18:01.640
You don't have to have a reason?

00:18:02.310 --> 00:18:03.770
Is that so?

00:18:07.060 --> 00:18:09.480
I see, then...

00:18:09.480 --> 00:18:15.280
I... I really do love him.

00:18:40.050 --> 00:18:42.720
When I realize I like him,

00:18:42.720 --> 00:18:44.390
I get turned down?

00:18:46.520 --> 00:18:50.940
If you ever need to cry,
come to me.

00:18:53.570 --> 00:18:58.280
Even now that phrase still
supports me,

00:18:59.150 --> 00:19:03.450
but when you make me cry,
what am I supposed to do?

00:19:06.290 --> 00:19:12.250
Today it's raining raining raining.

00:19:13.210 --> 00:19:15.130
Sana-chan didn't get over it yet?

00:19:15.130 --> 00:19:16.340
No.

00:19:16.340 --> 00:19:20.220
The director said he'll film scenes
that don't have Sana-chan in them first.

00:19:21.510 --> 00:19:26.640
But Sana-chan, who could even do
an adult's job,

00:19:26.640 --> 00:19:29.020
is so fragile with love.

00:19:30.640 --> 00:19:33.860
I can't forgive Hayama for
changing his mind.

00:19:33.860 --> 00:19:37.400
You can't stop a person's feelings
of love for someone.

00:19:37.400 --> 00:19:40.740
It's not that Hayama-kun is bad,
or anybody is bad.

00:19:43.410 --> 00:19:45.080
I see.

00:19:49.960 --> 00:19:53.920
Mama, what really happened to me?

00:19:55.000 --> 00:19:58.510
Hayama, I try not
to think about you,

00:19:59.210 --> 00:20:02.720
but tears come again and again.

00:20:03.300 --> 00:20:06.640
What am I going to do?
What should I do?

00:20:06.640 --> 00:20:10.020
Mama, I'm making everybody
worry about me.

00:20:20.530 --> 00:20:22.200
Naozumi-kun.

00:20:23.160 --> 00:20:25.160
I can't stop thinking about you,
Sana-chan.

00:20:25.160 --> 00:20:26.160
No!

00:20:26.160 --> 00:20:27.910
Not someone bad like me!

00:20:27.910 --> 00:20:29.200
Sana-chan...

00:20:29.540 --> 00:20:32.160
I never knew you were like this.

00:20:32.160 --> 00:20:35.500
It seems that I got turned down.

00:20:35.500 --> 00:20:39.880
Sorry, Naozumi-kun, but when I think
about you I say something very heartless.

00:20:39.880 --> 00:20:43.010
But I'm too occupied with myself.

00:20:43.010 --> 00:20:44.930
My mind is all messed up.

00:20:44.930 --> 00:20:47.350
I never knew I was such a weakling.

00:20:47.720 --> 00:20:50.350
Really... enough...

00:20:54.810 --> 00:20:57.270
Why? Why are you crying?

00:20:57.270 --> 00:20:59.780
Because you're crying, Sana-chan.

00:21:00.570 --> 00:21:01.690
Me?

00:21:01.690 --> 00:21:04.110
For you, Sana-chan...

00:21:09.580 --> 00:21:11.620
For you, Sana-chan,

00:21:11.620 --> 00:21:13.750
I can do anything.

00:21:14.540 --> 00:21:17.000
Anything, even if you love someone else.

00:21:17.920 --> 00:21:19.340
Naozumi-kun...

00:21:19.340 --> 00:21:21.710
I'll always be there for you,
Sana-chan!

00:21:21.710 --> 00:21:26.050
So don't cry, don't cry.

00:21:31.430 --> 00:21:33.480
Naozumi-kun...

00:21:36.140 --> 00:21:38.060
If you ever feel like crying...

00:21:39.480 --> 00:21:42.940
If you ever feel like crying,
come to me.

00:21:53.080 --> 00:21:54.700
I'm sorry.

00:21:56.710 --> 00:21:59.580
I'm sorry, Naozumi-kun.

00:22:00.380 --> 00:22:01.840
